---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact XConvert Pro" description="Contact the XConvert Pro team about product feedback, technical issues, or privacy questions.">
  <section class="container page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">CONTACT</span><h1>Send product feedback</h1><p>For bug reports, accessibility feedback, or privacy questions, use the public project repository.</p></section>
  <section class="container section" style="padding-top:10px"><article class="content-card prose">
    <h2>Project support</h2><p>XConvert Pro is maintained as a public project. Include the tool name, browser and operating system, a concise description of the issue, and the steps needed to reproduce it.</p>
    <p><a class="button button--primary" href="https://github.com/gpldroid/xcpro/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open GitHub issues ↗</a></p>
    <h2>Privacy questions</h2><p>For privacy-related questions, review the <a href="/pages/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a> and provide details that do not expose private image content or sensitive personal data.</p>
    <p>Do not attach confidential or personal images to public issue reports.</p>
  </article></section>
</BaseLayout>
